FOCUS ONLY ON THE LESSON CONTENT AND LESSON COUNT.

Do NOT modify the current progression flow. It is working correctly now.

Do NOT modify:
- boss progression
- minion progression
- crystal mechanics
- Tower navigation
- Home navigation
- game modes
